WEBVTT

00:02:59.383 --> 00:03:01.886
I'm talking about shame.

00:03:03.095 --> 00:03:04.263
Guilt.

00:03:05.348 --> 00:03:06.807
And embarrassment.

00:03:08.851 --> 00:03:14.023
These emotions can cause so much harm

00:03:14.065 --> 00:03:16.359
beyond the absence.

00:03:19.946 --> 00:03:24.492
Ben was a 32-year-old father

00:03:24.533 --> 00:03:27.662
at an agency that I run
called Fathers’ UpLift,

00:03:28.746 --> 00:03:33.125
where we help fathers love,
forgive and heal.